msgid "Required to be able to reset password if you forget it"
msgstr "Necesario para poder restablecer la contraseña si la olvidas"

msgid "Sign up"
msgstr "Crear cuenta"

msgid ""
"Create your private space, then link your Tesla account in a few steps."
msgstr ""
"Crea tu espacio privado y luego vincula tu cuenta Tesla en unos pasos."

msgid "Already registered?"
msgstr "¿Ya registrado?"

msgid "Login"
msgstr "Iniciar sesión"

#, python-format
msgid "Partner public key must be served over HTTPS (got %(scheme)s)."
msgstr ""
"La clave pública partner debe servirse por HTTPS (esquema recibido: "
"%(scheme)s)."

msgid "Could not read a host from that URL."
msgstr "No se pudo leer un host en esa URL."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Tesla always fetches the public key at https://%(host)s%(path)s — not at an "
"arbitrary path. Host the PEM there (any HTTPS server is fine: nginx, S3, "
"Cloudflare, GitHub Pages, …)."
msgstr ""
"Tesla siempre obtiene la clave pública en https://%(host)s%(path)s — no en "
"una ruta arbitraria. Aloja el PEM ahí (cualquier servidor HTTPS sirve: "
"nginx, S3, Cloudflare, GitHub Pages, …)."

msgid ""
"Tesla rejects localhost as a partner domain. Use a public HTTPS domain."
msgstr ""
"Tesla rechaza localhost como dominio partner. Usa un dominio HTTPS público."

#, python-format
msgid "Cannot reach %(url)s: %(err)s"
msgstr "No se puede alcanzar %(url)s: %(err)s"

#, python-format
msgid "%(url)s → HTTP %(code)s"
msgstr "%(url)s → HTTP %(code)s"

#, python-format
msgid "%(url)s does not contain a valid public key PEM"
msgstr "%(url)s no contiene un PEM de clave pública válido"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(url)s is reachable but does not match the local key (%(path)s). Re-upload "
"the file."
msgstr ""
"%(url)s es accesible pero no coincide con la clave local (%(path)s). Vuelve "
"a subir el archivo."

#, python-format
msgid "Public key OK: %(url)s"
msgstr "Clave pública correcta: %(url)s"

msgid "Missing Client ID / Secret."
msgstr "Faltan Client ID / Secret."

#, python-format
msgid "Partner token failed (%(code)s): %(body)s"
msgstr "Token partner fallido (%(code)s): %(body)s"

msgid "Missing app settings."
msgstr "Faltan ajustes de la aplicación."

msgid ""
"Tesla rejects localhost as a partner domain. Use a public HTTPS domain (e.g."
" robotcar.example.com)."
msgstr ""
"Tesla rechaza localhost como dominio partner. Usa un dominio HTTPS público "
"(ej. robotcar.example.com)."

#, python-format
msgid "Public key not reachable by Tesla before register: %(msg)s"
msgstr "Clave pública no accesible por Tesla antes del registro: %(msg)s"

#, python-format
msgid "Partner register failed (%(code)s): %(body)s"
msgstr "Registro partner fallido (%(code)s): %(body)s"

msgid "Client ID"
msgstr "Client ID"

msgid "Client secret"
msgstr "Client secret"

msgid "OAuth redirect URI"
msgstr "URI de redirección OAuth"

msgid "Fleet API region"
msgstr "Región API Fleet"

msgid ""
"Must match the redirect URI on developer.tesla.com exactly (often "
"http://localhost:8001/oauth/callback for a local install)."
msgstr ""
"Debe coincidir exactamente con la URI de redirección en developer.tesla.com "
"(a menudo http://localhost:8001/oauth/callback en una instalación local)."

msgid "Europe / Middle East / Africa (recommended for Belgium)"
msgstr "Europa / Oriente Medio / África (recomendado para Bélgica)"

msgid "North America / Asia-Pacific (excl. China)"
msgstr "Norteamérica / Asia-Pacífico (excl. China)"

msgid "China"
msgstr "China"

msgid "Partner domain or public key URL"
msgstr "Dominio partner o URL de la clave pública"

msgid ""
"Paste a domain (example.com), an origin (https://example.com), or the full "
"public-key URL. Hosting is free choice (nginx, S3, Cloudflare, GitHub Pages,"
" …) but Tesla always fetches /.well-known/appspecific/com.tesla.3p.public-"
"key.pem on that host. Add the same host with https:// as Allowed Origin on "
"developer.tesla.com. Not localhost."
msgstr ""
"Pega un dominio (example.com), un origen (https://example.com) o la URL "
"completa de la clave pública. El alojamiento es libre (nginx, S3, "
"Cloudflare, GitHub Pages, …) pero Tesla siempre obtiene /.well-"
"known/appspecific/com.tesla.3p.public-key.pem en ese host. Añade el mismo "
"host con https:// como Allowed Origin en developer.tesla.com. No localhost."

